malized trait impls the requirement lists equals the impls rustdoc reports (`trait_impls`). A missing or extra Clone, Copy, Debug, Default or Serialize impl would fail.\n- It asserts that the requirement's declaration equals rustdoc's item declaration (`signature_parts`). That includes the `#[non_exhaustive]` attribute and the field names and types `u64`/`u64`. A changed field, type or visibility would fail.\n- It asserts separately that a struct with public fields is `#[non_exhaustive]`.\n- It asserts that the inventory export set matches rustdoc exactly, so removing or adding the export is caught.\n\nThe assertions enforce the requirement's text, and I found no unchecked obligation.",
